{"about_the_game":"The classic snake game is back merged with the Jankenpon game! A relaxing casual game where you eat the fruits and needs be aware of the symbols: if you are rock, paper will make you grow 3 times longer the default, scissors will not change your size and rock will produce the classic behavior.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1452300/extras/38dad4cda011e77b13f1328a8c047b1a.poster.avif?t=1681998531\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1452300/extras/38dad4cda011e77b13f1328a8c047b1a.webm?t=1681998531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1452300/extras/38dad4cda011e77b13f1328a8c047b1a.mp4?t=1681998531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1452300/extras/73f2d77abf4908b7196e1cd2edf3dd3d.webp?t=1681998531\" width=600 height=58 /></span><br><br>Who does not know this game? Move the snake around the board, eat the fruits, avoid the walls and the snake tail. That's all... not really...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1452300/extras/046c25790cb67bc5987dc3ae47b7d881.webp?t=1681998531\" width=600 height=58 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1452300/extras/62242cf5a8fa51de95dd00bdd0303b26.poster.avif?t=1681998531\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1452300/extras/62242cf5a8fa51de95dd00bdd0303b26.webm?t=1681998531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=